<title>USA: PHLX to list five new equity options this week.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list five new equity options this week.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said it will list options on Pilgrim's Pride Corp and Stage Stores Inc on Wednesday, August 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said it will also list options on Journal Register Co, Key Energy Group Inc and St. John Knits Inc on Friday, August 15.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and spcialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
